Q: MemoryStream - Cannot access a closed Stream A: <p>Change <code>MemoryStream</code> object to <code>Stream</code> and you can write to any file as it won't be closed any more.</p>
<pre class="lang-cs prettyprint-override"><code>Stream streamIo = new MemoryStream(memoryStream.ToArray());
</code></pre>
